' ==========================================
' Domain Relationships & Composition
' ==========================================

' Tasks Internal Composition & Associations
Task *-- "0..*" TaskChecklistItem : checklist
Task *-- "0..1" TaskRecurringRule : recurringRule
TaskRecurringRule *-- "0..*" RecurringException : exceptions
Task "0..1" --> "0..1" Task : parentTaskId
Task "0..*" --> "0..*" Requirement : requirementIds
Task "0..1" <-- "0..*" TaskAlert : taskId
Task "0..1" <-- "0..*" TaskCompletionFeedback : taskId

' Projects Internal Composition & Associations
Project *-- "0..1" SmartObjective : smartObjective
Project *-- "0..*" BacklogIdea : backlogIdeas
Project *-- "0..1" DashboardMetricPreferences : preferences
DashboardMetricPreferences *-- "1" DashboardManualVisibility : manualVisibility

Project "1" *-- "0..*" WBSNode : wbsNodes
Project "1" *-- "0..*" Risk : risks
Project "1" *-- "0..*" ProjectWave : waves
Project "1" *-- "0..*" ProjectProgressRecord : progressHistory
Project "1" --> "0..1" ProjectBuffer : buffer
Project "1" --> "0..1" XMatrixSnapshot : snapshot

' Cross-Domain Entity Linkage
Project "1" <-- "0..*" Task : projectId
WBSNode "0..1" <-- "0..*" Task : parentWbsNodeId
Project "1" --> "0..*" TaskDependency : dependencies
TaskDependency "*" --> "1" Task : taskId
TaskDependency "*" --> "1" Task : dependsOnTaskId

' DTO Specializations & Inheritance
UpdateTaskDto --|> CreateTaskDto
CreateMicroTaskDto --|> CreateTaskDto
UpdateProjectDto --|> CreateProjectDto
WBSNodeDto *-- "0..*" WBSNodeDto : children

' View & Analytics Aggregations
GanttDataResponse o-- "0..*" GanttTaskItem : tasks
GanttDataResponse o-- "0..*" GanttDependencyItem : dependencies
GanttDataResponse o-- "0..*" PackageCriticalityItem : packageCriticality

PertDiagramDataResponse o-- "0..*" PertDiagramNode : nodes
PertDiagramDataResponse o-- "0..*" PertDiagramEdge : edges
PertDiagramDataResponse o-- "1" PertDiagramStatistics : statistics
PertDiagramDataResponse o-- "0..*" PackageCriticalityItem : packageCriticality

EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMForecast : forecast
EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMCurve : curve
EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMTotals : totals
EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMPersonalMetrics : personalMetrics
EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMMilestoneProgress : milestoneProgress
EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMDashboardPreferences : dashboardPreferences
EVMSummary o-- "1" EVMMetricRelevance : metricRelevance
EVMMetricRelevance o-- "8" EVMMetricVisibility : metricVisibility

XMatrixResponseDto o-- "0..*" XMatrixAxisItemDto : axisItems
XMatrixResponseDto o-- "0..*" XMatrixCellDto : cells
XMatrixResponseDto o-- "1" XMatrixDiagnosticsDto : diagnostics

AiSuggestionsResponseDto o-- "0..*" AiTaskSuggestionDto : suggestions
AiSuggestionsResponseDto o-- "1" AiSuggestionsProgressDto : progress
PertEstimateResponseDto o-- "1" PertEstimateDto : estimate

' ==========================================
' Architectural Notes
' ==========================================
note top of Task
    <b>Core Task Entity</b>
    - Represents actionable work, micro-tasks, and habits (microTaskType = 'habit').
    - RTM traceability: links to WBS (parentWbsNodeId, wbsPath) and Requirements.
    - Integrated with PERT (3-point estimates) & EVM tracking.
end note

note top of Project
    <b>Project Root Entity</b>
    - Encapsulates Catchball/SMART goals, WBS hierarchy, waves, and risk registers.
    - Drives CPM/PERT critical path analysis and X-Matrix strategic alignment.
end note

@enduml